  "description": "The META POWER SX AVINOX PODIUM offers the most advanced configuration to push the boundaries of what's possible on an ebike.\n• The FOX Podium Factory in 160 mm is paired with the FOX Float X2 Factory shock absorber. They offer an exceptional level of precision, stiffness, and support. The ultimate combination to dominate the most demanding trails.\n• SHIMANO XT 4-piston braking with GALFER Shark 203/203 mm discs ensures maximum power and consistency in extreme conditions.\n• DT SWISS HX1700 wheels mounted on DT SWISS 350 hubs guarantee strength, precision, and quick engagement. The hubs feature the DEG DF (Degrees of Freedom) system, adjustable to 0° or 10°: an anti-kickback device that decouples the drivetrain from the suspension for greater freedom of movement and reduced pedal kickback.\n• The SRAM GX Eagle 12-speed drivetrain, combined with the E13 Helix Race 155 mm crankset, offers fast and reliable gear changes.",
